{
  "slug": "size-chart",
  "title": "Yoga Democracy Activewear, Eco-Friendly",
  "description": "Eco-Friendly activewear for yoga, run and leisure. Leggings, yoga shorts and tops. Highest rated for hot yoga. Leading brand in recycled, eco-friendly women's activewear. Sustainable workout clothes made from recycled plastic. Sizes 2XS-3XL. Free Shipping + Returns",
  "source_url": "https://www.yogademocracy.com/size-chart.html",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Master Size Chart",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "How To Measure",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "BAND SIZE: While standing with an unpadded bra on, measure around the chest just under your arms with no slack in tape, right above the bust. Round up If your result is a fraction (ex. 34.5\u201d rounded to the nearest whole number, your band measurement is 35\u201d)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "BUST SIZE: While standing with an unpadded bra on, loosely measure around the fullest part of your bust. Round to the nearest whole number. (ex. 34.5\u201d rounded up to the nearest whole number, your bust size is 35\u201d)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "CUP SIZE: Subtract your final Band size from your final Bust size to find your Cup Size. (1\u201d difference = A Cup, 2\u201d B Cup, 3\u201d C Cup, 4\u201d D Cup, 5\u201d DD Cup, 6\u201d DDD Cup)"
    },
    {
